    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "These are bunch of seven C482 Applications, which call for consideration of a penal action to be taken in several complaint proceedings, which has been respectively referred to in the C482 Applications, requiring a trial for the offence under Sections 26 (2), 27, 66 to be read with Section 3 I1) (zf) (C) (i) and 3 (1) (zz) (v), which are punishable under Sections 52 and 59 of the Food Safety Standards Act, 2006.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 572,
      "end": 988,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sections 26 (2)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 816,
          "end": 831
        },
        {
